# Wand [Add Mana, SB, SB, Chainsaw], all drawn: resources are columns, the cast block's cost is a fold; flavor integers, not the wiki's.
n 5
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4
col wand bool 1 0 0 0 0
col mana num 50 0 0 0 0
col delay num 0 0 0 0 0
col recharge num 0 0 0 0 0
col spell bool 0 1 1 1 1
col slot num -1 0 1 2 3
col proj bool 0 0 1 1 1
col addMana bool 0 1 0 0 0
col manaCost num 0 0 5 5 1
col castDelay num 0 0 5 5 -17
col rechargeTime num 0 0 10 10 -20
ja 杖 wand
ja 魔力 mana
ja 遅延 delay
ja 再充填 recharge
ja 呪文 spell
ja 枠 slot
ja 投射 proj
ja 加魔 addMana
ja 消費魔力 manaCost
ja 詠唱遅延 castDelay
ja 再充填時間 rechargeTime
